WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Trace an algorithm by hand

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
List the inputs and starting values.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Make one row for each assignment or loop iteration.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Try a boundary input and confirm which branch executes.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:25.280
With a running total starting at 0, processing 2, 4 and 6 yields totals of 2, 6 and 12 in successive rows.
